# database dumps
# Schema is owned by SchemaManager (dbDelta, version-gated) — no SQL file
# in this repo is ever the source of truth, so a *.sql here is always an
# ad-hoc dump. They routinely carry production user rows and password
# hashes, and this repo auto-deploys to production over FTP.
*.sql
*.sql.gz
*.sql.zip
